<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n48740" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">trans-ăbĕo</span></b> ,
			ĭi, īre, v. a. and
			n. (<b>poet.</b>). <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>I.</b>
			<i>Act.</i>, <i>to go beyond</i>, <i>pass by</i>: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">populos atque aequora longe Transabeunt,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Val.
					Fl. 4, 510</span></i>
			: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">aliquem fugā,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Stat.
					Th. 6, 507</span></i>
			: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">difficultate,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">App. M. 8, p. 208, 21</span></i>
			. — <i>Neutr.</i>: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">transabiit non hunc sitiens gravis hasta
					cruorem,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Sil.
					12, 264</span></i>
			. — </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>II.</b>
			<i>To go through.</i>
		</div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>A.</b> Of a weapon, <i>to pierce through</i>, <i>transfix</i>: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">ensis Transabiit costas,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Verg.
					A. 9, 432</span></i>
			: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">costas (ensis),</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Stat.
					Th. 2, 9</span></i>
			: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">aliquem (trabs),</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">id. ib. 9, 126</span></i>
			.—</div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>B.</b> Of a
			person: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">per medias acies infesti militis transabivi,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">App. M. 7, p. 191, 11</span></i>
			.</div>
    </div> <div class="alpheios-lex-footnotes en"> </div>
